---
title: Books and slot counts
pageSlug: books-and-slots
mod: spell-actionbar
section: gameplay
order: 3
---

Slot count follows your equipped Curios spellbook.

- **No book:** 3 slots
- **Equipped book:** the bar grows to that book’s max spell capacity
- **Packed book spells** lock into the leading slots. They cast from the book and cannot be moved in the equip screen
- Remaining slots are yours for player scrolls

If the book shrinks or locks over a scroll slot, those scrolls are returned to your inventory (dropped if full).

With [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex), action bar slots still follow the equipped empty Curios spellbook (default **3** with no book). Wide books and long school lists scroll horizontally in the Codex UI.
